        <mxCell id="u_start" value="Старт
GET /admin/
Superadmin login
(email + password)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontColor=#333333;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="80" width="240" height="70" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="u_create" value="⚠ BOTTLENECK:
Superadmin НЕ auto-created.
Только ручная команда:
python manage.py init_superadmin
читает SUPERADMIN_EMAIL/
PASSWORD из .env" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="340" y="80" width="240" height="70" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="u_staff" value="is_staff=True +
some Unfold actions
@superuser_only_action" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="180" width="240" height="70" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="u_nav" value="Unfold dashboard:
